## 5 · 🔒 IDENTITY AND SECURITY

> ## ⛔ THIS SECTION NEVER CARRIES A VALUE
> No passwords, no tokens, no keys, no emails, no connection strings. **It says WHERE, never WHAT.**
> Operational details (rotation state, network surface, trigger conditions) live in the private
> security file, never in this public template. A leaked secret is **ROTATED, not deleted**
> (`rules/rule-config-hygiene.md` §1.1).

| | |
|---|---|
| Founder | **{{owner}}** — full identity in the private config, never hardcoded here |
| Master KEK | **always offline.** Never on the server |
| Plaintext secrets | **{{owner}} never sees them** |
| Audit trail | immutable — no `UPDATE`, no `DELETE` |
| `Mente/secrets/` | 700, files 600, gitignored, **no `!README.md` exception** |
| Server credential rotation | ⚠️ **policy, mitigant and trigger conditions tracked in the private security file** — not here |

